==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro}} ''[[taverne]]'' ‘wine shop’, from {{etyl|la}} ''[[taberna]]'' ‘inn’.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ævə(r)n}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A building containing a [[bar]] licensed to sell [[alcoholic]] [[drink]]s; an [[inn]].
# {{rfc-sense}} [[parlour|Parlour]].

====Derived terms====
* [[tavernous]]

